let's get this on paper.

00:34:00.050 --> 00:34:02.906
And what you can do when you're
negotiating with these kind of people is

00:34:02.906 --> 00:34:06.045
to try to like, if they are saying,
come back with this really hard thing, and

00:34:06.045 --> 00:34:07.209
then maybe I'll say, yes.

00:34:08.750 --> 00:34:12.140
Move them down to something you can do,
to something that's more minor, and

00:34:12.140 --> 00:34:13.850
then try to get it in writing.

00:34:13.850 --> 00:34:15.771
And once you get something in writing,
it's so

00:34:15.771 --> 00:34:18.277
much more likely they'll do the deal
because talk is cheap, man.

00:34:18.277 --> 00:34:23.360
Anyone could say, we'll give you
a million dollars if you do whatever.

00:34:23.360 --> 00:34:26.982
