a corporation to put something to paper,

00:34:26.982 --> 00:34:31.010
they're either come up with an excuse why
they can't or they're actually serious.

00:34:31.010 --> 00:34:33.740
And think about how much better
that would be for you as founders,

00:34:33.740 --> 00:34:36.380
if you had somebody writing,
then you'd know this is real.

00:34:36.380 --> 00:34:37.080
And that can give you so

00:34:37.080 --> 00:34:39.310
much more confidence that you're
going down the right direction.

00:34:40.355 --> 00:34:41.795
So that's always something
